<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title><%= pageTitle %></title>
<meta name="description" content="<%= metaDescription %>">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
<link rel="icon" href="/images/favicon.ico">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Products &amp; Services</span>
    <h1>Mobility</h1>
    <p>Managing business mobiles shouldn't be complex. We take control of your mobile fleet with complete visibility, cost optimisation, and hands-on local support — right-sized plans for the way your team actually works.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Schedule an obligation-free chat</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-head__copy">
        <h1>Plans built for how your team works</h1>
        <p>Every plan includes fleet visibility and local support as standard — pick the data allowance that suits each role.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="carousel" data-carousel>
      <div class="carousel__viewport">

        <article class="plan-card">
          <p class="plan-card__name">Lite Business Plan</p>
          <p class="plan-card__data">20<span>GB data</span></p>
          <p class="plan-card__sub">Ideal for light users and single-device staff</p>
          <ul class="plan-card__list">
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Unlimited standard talk &amp; text</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> 5G ready, national coverage</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Fleet visibility dashboard</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm">Schedule a chat</a>
        </article>

        <article class="plan-card">
          <p class="plan-card__name">Everyday Business Plan</p>
          <p class="plan-card__data">60<span>GB data</span></p>
          <p class="plan-card__sub">Our most popular plan for day-to-day teams</p>
          <ul class="plan-card__list">
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Unlimited standard talk &amp; text</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> International calls to 15 countries</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Fleet visibility dashboard</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Local hands-on support</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm">Schedule a chat</a>
        </article>

        <article class="plan-card">
          <p class="plan-card__name">Power Business Plan</p>
          <p class="plan-card__data">100<span>GB data</span></p>
          <p class="plan-card__sub">For teams that work hard on the road</p>
          <ul class="plan-card__list">
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Unlimited standard talk &amp; text</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> International calls to 30 countries</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Priority fleet support</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Device insurance available</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm">Schedule a chat</a>
        </article>

        <article class="plan-card">
          <p class="plan-card__name">Unlimited Business Plan</p>
          <p class="plan-card__data">&infin;<span>data</span></p>
          <p class="plan-card__sub">Unlimited data for your heaviest users</p>
          <ul class="plan-card__list">
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Unlimited standard talk &amp; text</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> International calls to 40+ countries</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Dedicated account manager</li>
            <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Device insurance available</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--sm">Schedule a chat</a>
        </article>

      </div>

      <div class="carousel__controls">
        <button type="button" class="round-btn" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Previous plans">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M10 2L4 8l6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="carousel__progress"><div class="carousel__progress-bar"></div></div>
        <button type="button" class="round-btn" data-carousel-next aria-label="Next plans">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M6 2l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel__dots"></div>
      <p class="scroll-hint">
        Swipe or drag to see more plans
        <svg width="14" height="10" viewBox="0 0 14 10" fill="none"><path d="M1 5h11M8 1l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- ---- Available now: hardware ---- -->
    <div id="hardware" class="subsection-head">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Available now</span>
        <h3>Business-grade hardware, ready to ship</h3>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="carousel" data-carousel>
      <div class="carousel__viewport">

        <article class="device-card">
          <div class="device-card__media">
            <!-- <img src="/images/hardware/iphone-16.jpg" alt="iPhone 16" loading="lazy" width="210" height="210"> -->
            <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="6" y="2" width="12" height="20" rx="2.5" stroke="var(--ict-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="12" cy="18.3" r="0.8" fill="var(--ict-blue)"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="device-card__body">
            <span class="device-card__tag">In stock</span>
            <p class="device-card__name">iPhone 16</p>
            <p class="device-card__note">128GB &middot; business plans available</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="device-card">
          <div class="device-card__media">
            <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="6" y="2" width="12" height="20" rx="2.5" stroke="var(--ict-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="12" cy="18.3" r="0.8" fill="var(--ict-blue)"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="device-card__body">
            <span class="device-card__tag">In stock</span>
            <p class="device-card__name">iPhone 16 Pro</p>
            <p class="device-card__note">256GB &middot; business plans available</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="device-card">
          <div class="device-card__media">
            <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="6" y="2" width="12" height="20" rx="2.5" stroke="var(--ict-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="12" cy="18.3" r="0.8" fill="var(--ict-blue)"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="device-card__body">
            <span class="device-card__tag">In stock</span>
            <p class="device-card__name">Samsung Galaxy S25</p>
            <p class="device-card__note">128GB &middot; business plans available</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="device-card">
          <div class="device-card__media">
            <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="6" y="2" width="12" height="20" rx="2.5" stroke="var(--ict-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="12" cy="18.3" r="0.8" fill="var(--ict-blue)"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="device-card__body">
            <span class="device-card__tag">Limited stock</span>
            <p class="device-card__name">Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra</p>
            <p class="device-card__note">256GB &middot; business plans available</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="device-card">
          <div class="device-card__media">
            <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="6" y="2" width="12" height="20" rx="2.5" stroke="var(--ict-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="12" cy="18.3" r="0.8" fill="var(--ict-blue)"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="device-card__body">
            <span class="device-card__tag">In stock</span>
            <p class="device-card__name">Samsung Galaxy Fold6</p>
            <p class="device-card__note">256GB &middot; business plans available</p>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>

      <div class="carousel__controls">
        <button type="button" class="round-btn" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Previous devices">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M10 2L4 8l6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="carousel__progress"><div class="carousel__progress-bar"></div></div>
        <button type="button" class="round-btn" data-carousel-next aria-label="Next devices">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M6 2l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="carousel__dots"></div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="section--tint">
  <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;">
    <h1>Not sure which plan fits?</h1>
    <p style="margin-inline:auto;">Tell us how your team works and we'll recommend the right mix — no pressure, no obligation.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Schedule an obligation-free chat</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>

<script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
